# Tailwind + shadcn/ui

Inspired by the `awesome-cursorrules` tailwind-css-nextjs guide. Use Tailwind v4 utilities and shadcn/ui primitives from `src/components/ui/`.

## Mobile-first responsive

- Start with the base (mobile) styles, then layer `sm:`, `md:`, `lg:`, `xl:`.
- Test at 360px width minimum. Avoid fixed pixel widths; prefer `w-full`, `max-w-*`, `min-h-screen`.

```tsx
// GOOD — mobile first, then scales up
<div className="flex flex-col gap-3 p-4 sm:flex-row sm:gap-6 sm:p-6 lg:p-8" />
```

## RTL + Hebrew

- The app is Hebrew-first (`<html lang="he" dir="rtl">`).
- Use **logical properties**: `ms-*`/`me-*`, `ps-*`/`pe-*`, `start-*`/`end-*`, `text-start`/`text-end`.
- Never use `ml-*`, `mr-*`, `pl-*`, `pr-*`, `text-left`, `text-right` for layout direction.
- Icons that imply direction (arrows, chevrons) must mirror in RTL or use direction-neutral icons.

```tsx
// BAD — breaks in RTL
<div className="ml-4 text-left" />

// GOOD — direction-aware
<div className="ms-4 text-start" />
```

## Design tokens

- Use CSS variables from `globals.css`: `bg-background`, `text-foreground`, `text-muted-foreground`, `border-border`, `bg-primary`, etc.
- Never hardcode colors (`#fff`, `bg-blue-500`) for theme-able surfaces. Hex is allowed only for brand or static illustrations.
- Spacing scale: `gap-2`, `gap-4`, `gap-6`, `gap-8`. Radius: `rounded-md`, `rounded-lg`, `rounded-xl`.

## shadcn/ui

- Compose from `@/components/ui/*`. Do **not** rewrite primitives; extend with `className` and `cn()`.
- Add new primitives via `npx shadcn@latest add <component>`, not by hand.
- App-specific components live in `src/components/<feature>/` and use `ui/` parts internally.

## Accessibility

- Every interactive element is reachable by keyboard and has a visible focus ring (`focus-visible:*`).
- Provide `aria-label` for icon-only buttons; provide labels for inputs.
- Headings follow document order (`h1` → `h2` → `h3`). One `h1` per page.
- Color is never the sole signal — pair with text or icon.
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion` for animations.

```tsx
// BAD — icon button with no label
<Button size="icon"><X /></Button>

// GOOD
<Button size="icon" aria-label="סגירה"><X /></Button>
```

## Reusable components

- Props use a `Props` type / interface; expose `className` and forward refs when wrapping primitives.
- Avoid prop explosion — extract sub-components when more than ~8 props accumulate.
